# Vehicle Zone Intrusion Alert System

An AI-powered CCTV surveillance system that detects vehicles entering a restricted zone inside a company premises.

The system continuously monitors CCTV footage and triggers alerts when two or more vehicles enter the predefined danger zone.

---

# Features

- Real-time vehicle detection
- Restricted zone monitoring
- Multi-vehicle intrusion detection
- AI-based object detection
- Automatic image capture
- Live camera and video support

---

# Workflow

1. CCTV feed is captured
2. AI model detects vehicles
3. Vehicles entering the specified zone are counted
4. If vehicle count >= 2:
   - Alert is triggered
   - Screenshot is captured
   

